Title: "Expectations, Outcomes, and Challenges of Modern Code Review"

Venue : ICSE 2013

Number of Pages: 10

Link: https://sback.it/publications/icse2013.pdf

Summary: The authors in this article explain how the main challenge in software code 
reviews are understanding the context and purpose of code changes. It is highlighted that 
reviewers often lack important context about new code, but time constraints push them to 
provide feedback even when it may not be efficient.
